WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:03.218
The question was practical: could modifying a

00:00:03.218 --> 00:00:05.787
plant based PLA film make it adhere

00:00:05.787 --> 00:00:08.355
more strongly to aluminium? The peel test

00:00:08.355 --> 00:00:09.823
would give the answer.

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:18.886
Cold plasma changes the outermost polymer surface,

00:00:18.886 --> 00:00:22.122
creating reactive sites. The study then grafted

00:00:22.122 --> 00:00:25.358
ascorbic or fumaric acid onto the treated

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:26.283
PLA film.

00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:33.906
The authors measured contact angles and surface

00:00:33.906 --> 00:00:37.163
free energy. Both help characterize wetting, but

00:00:37.163 --> 00:00:40.419
neither measurement alone proves stronger laminate adhesion.

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:48.500
The X ray photoelectron spectra belong to

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:51.349
this exact PLA film paper. They help

00:00:51.349 --> 00:00:54.199
characterize the chemistry of the surface after

00:00:54.199 --> 00:00:55.013
the treatments.

00:01:00.650 --> 00:01:04.267
This published figure compares peel resistance of

00:01:04.267 --> 00:01:07.884
untreated PLA, plasma treated samples, grafted samples,

00:01:07.884 --> 00:01:10.985
and blind controls without plasma activation.

00:01:15.650 --> 00:01:18.586
Untreated film averaged seventy four point four

00:01:18.586 --> 00:01:21.521
newtons per metre. The fumaric acid grafted

00:01:21.521 --> 00:01:24.457
sample reached two hundred eleven newtons per

00:01:24.457 --> 00:01:26.134
metre, the largest increase.

00:01:30.650 --> 00:01:33.708
Adding the acids without prior plasma treatment

00:01:33.708 --> 00:01:36.766
gave results close to untreated film. That

00:01:36.766 --> 00:01:39.824
blind control is central to how the

00:01:39.824 --> 00:01:41.134
researchers interpreted grafting.

00:01:45.650 --> 00:01:49.039
These results describe PLA film and aluminium

00:01:49.039 --> 00:01:52.428
peel adhesion. They must not be illustrated

00:01:52.428 --> 00:01:55.817
with the separate twenty twenty antimicrobial electrospun

00:01:55.817 --> 00:01:56.785
scaffold experiment.
